FreeBSD/aarch64 instead of the Linux-only <asm/hwcap.h> (series 1002).
For Chromium's zlib; not submitted upstream yet.
--- third_party/zlib/BUILD.gn.orig	2026-09-29 08:00:52 UTC
+++ third_party/zlib/BUILD.gn
